{#
  Reveal control of the revealable secret rows (1.15): the endpoint URLs (one per field), the CSRF token of the section
  and the markup the page script clones into each marked row
  (`data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal="<field>"`, set by SettingsSectionType).
  Variable: secret_reveal (Ui\SecretReveal), set by the section page only for a user who may reveal
  (SecretRevealer::canReveal(): the UI gate, the section area and the reveal roles). Host section templates include it
  the same way: {{ include('@NowoInstanceSettingsBundle/settings/_secret_reveal.html.twig') }}.
  Optional: nonce (default the request attribute csp_nonce), bundle (UiKit class bundle of the page).

  The root names its section (`data-section`) and each marked row carries the same section name, so a page that embeds
  two sections (TEMPLATES.md) keeps every row with the URLs and the token of its own section (audit F3).
  No secret is ever printed here: the page carries the button, the endpoint URL and the token only; the plaintext is
  fetched by the script when the user clicks Reveal, shown in the row and dropped again on Hide (or after the script's
  auto-hide delay). Copy puts it on the operating system clipboard, which the browser does not let the page clear
  reliably: Hide asks for it to be emptied, best effort only (audit F4). Without JavaScript nothing is added and the field stays write-only, as before 1.15.
  1.16 (web_ui.reveal_on_toggle): the root also carries data-on-toggle and the eye labels; the script then binds the
  PasswordToggle eye of each revealable row to the same reveal call, shows the answer in the same read-only <output>
  (no name: never part of the submitted form) and leaves the typed input untouched. data-toggle-only
  (web_ui.reveal_toggle_only) hides the Reveal / Copy / Hide buttons of rows that have the eye.
  1.17 (web_ui.reveal_in_input, data-in-input): a row marked data-nowo-instance-settings-locked (a stored secret) is
  LOCKED: the script makes its input read-only and the eye shows the stored value IN that input (type=text, autofill,
  spellcheck and autocorrect off) and hides it again; ticking the row's "Replace the stored value" box (rendered by the
  form) unlocks an empty input. The status span announces "shown" / "hidden", never the value.
  No inline handler and no style attribute (strict CSP safe).
#}
{%- set _b = bundle|default(null) -%}
{%- set _request = app is defined and app ? app.request : null -%}
{%- set _nonce = nonce|default(_request ? _request.attributes.get('csp_nonce') : null) -%}
<div class="nowo-instance-settings-reveal" data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-root data-section="{{ secret_reveal.section }}" data-urls="{{ secret_reveal.urlsJson }}" data-token="{{ csrf_token(secret_reveal.tokenId) }}" data-copied-label="{{ 'reveal.copied'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}" data-error-label="{{ 'reveal.error'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}" data-empty-label="{{ 'reveal.not_stored'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}"{% if secret_reveal.onToggle %} data-on-toggle="true" data-toggle-show-label="{{ 'reveal.toggle_show'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}" data-toggle-hide-label="{{ 'reveal.toggle_hide'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}"{% if secret_reveal.toggleOnly %} data-toggle-only="true"{% endif %}{% if secret_reveal.inInput %} data-in-input="true" data-shown-label="{{ 'reveal.announce_shown'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}" data-hidden-label="{{ 'reveal.announce_hidden'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}"{% endif %}{% endif %} data-testid="instance-settings-reveal">
    <template data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-template>
        <div class="nowo-instance-settings-reveal__controls">
            <button type="button" class="{{ (nowo_ui_class('btn_secondary', _b) ~ ' ' ~ nowo_ui_class('btn_sm', _b))|trim }}" data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-show>{{ 'reveal.show'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}</button>
            <button type="button" class="{{ (nowo_ui_class('btn_secondary', _b) ~ ' ' ~ nowo_ui_class('btn_sm', _b))|trim }}" data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-copy hidden>{{ 'reveal.copy'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}</button>
            <button type="button" class="{{ (nowo_ui_class('btn_secondary', _b) ~ ' ' ~ nowo_ui_class('btn_sm', _b))|trim }}" data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-hide hidden>{{ 'reveal.hide'|trans({}, 'NowoInstanceSettingsBundle') }}</button>
            <output class="nowo-instance-settings-reveal__value" data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-output aria-live="polite" hidden></output>
            <span class="nowo-instance-settings-reveal__status" data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </div>
    </template>
</div>
<script src="{{ asset('bundles/nowoinstancesettings/js/nowo-instance-settings-reveal.js') }}" defer{% if _nonce %} nonce="{{ _nonce }}"{% endif %} data-nowo-instance-settings-reveal-script></script>
